# Copy to .dev.vars (gitignored) for `npx wrangler@4 pages dev`. Secrets only;
# plain settings live in wrangler.toml. In the cloud the same secret is set in
# the Pages dashboard, or with `npx wrangler@4 pages secret put PROXY_SECRET`.
#
# Must equal the API's PROXY_SECRET (app.proxy.secret). Leave it empty locally
# unless you are testing the shared-secret check itself.
PROXY_SECRET=
